    "text": "Hint: \r\n$\\operatorname{lt}_{x \\rightarrow 1}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\ln x}-\\frac{1}{x-1}\\right)=\\operatorname{lt}_{x \\rightarrow 1} \\frac{(x-1)-\\ln x}{(x-1) \\ln x}=\\frac{1}{2}$\r\nUsing L.H. rule twice"
